# Routes 42 to 44, the Lake of Rage and their gate houses: HeartGold gives the mountain roads of the north one theme
# (SEQ_GS_R_7_42), and this game a song of its own: a bright horn in D major striding over a rolling harp, held
# strings and a walking bass, the road climbing past Mt. Mortar toward the snow. Original composition for this game
# (plan 20 · J10).
